    {
      "title": "Trump threatens ‘tremendous penalties’ for US tech firms that build datacenters abroad",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/20/trump-datacenters-white-house",
      "description": "<p>President gives wide-ranging White House press conference and says he has ‘fantastic relationships’ with Putin and Xi</p><p>Donald Trump threatened on Friday to impose “tremendous penalties” on American tech companies that build datacenters outside the US, though he gave no details and told reporters he had not yet informed his own officials about the plan.</p><p>In a discursive press conference from the White House briefing room, Trump also said he would “look into” the report that Iran had been planning to possibly detonate a “dirty bomb” in Washington DC, and backed JD Vance over comments the vice-president made blaming Republican midterm losses on the Iran war.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/20/trump-datacenters-white-house\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-20T21:47:41"
    },
    {
      "title": "Trump turns White House press conference into a 2028 succession audition",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/20/trump-republican-succession-battle-vance-rubio",
      "description": "<p>The president appeared to put Vance and Rubio through their paces as potential successors, though Stephen Miller unexpectedly stole the spotlight</p><p>“Which of you shall we say doth love us most?”</p><p>The ageing <a href=\"https://www.folger.edu/explore/shakespeares-works/king-lear/read/\">King Lear’s</a> question to his daughters, expecting them to compete for his favour and carve up his kingdom, hovered in the White House press briefing room on Friday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/20/trump-republican-succession-battle-vance-rubio\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-21T00:16:26"
    },
